                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Edge from (x1, y1) to (x2, y2): put the path at x = min(x), y = min(y) with viewBox [0, 0, w, h] and geometry \"M0 a C w/2 a w/2 b w b\", where a = y1 - yMin and b = y2 - yMin. Port centers come from the manifest.",
